sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Writer
    participant Skill as Claude Code skill
    participant Directus as Directus API
    participant Jira as Jira ZW
    participant Blog as blog.zspace.com

    Writer->>Skill: Approve publish
    Skill->>Skill: Read .env for URL and personal token
    Skill->>Directus: POST /items/mkt_blog with title, slug, content, excerpt, status, display_date, author
    Directus-->>Skill: 200 with new post id
    Skill->>Directus: POST /items/mkt_blog_mkt_blog_categories with post id and category id
    Directus-->>Skill: 200 link created
    Skill->>Directus: GET /items/mkt_blog/{id} to verify
    Directus-->>Skill: Record — slug and status may have been rewritten by a Flow
    alt slug or status was rewritten
        Skill->>Directus: PATCH /items/mkt_blog/{id} to restore intended values
        Directus-->>Skill: 200 corrected
        Skill->>Writer: Flag the mismatch
    end
    Skill->>Directus: GET /users/me to resolve writer email
    Directus-->>Skill: email for Jira reporter and mention
    Skill->>Jira: lookupJiraAccountId for writer, JP, Joe, Aaron
    Jira-->>Skill: accountIds
    Skill->>Jira: createJiraIssue — Provide image for blog, assigned to David Cipres, 1920x1080
    Jira-->>Skill: ZW-NNNN
    Note over Skill,Jira: If Jira fails the blog stays published — surface error, do not roll back
    Skill->>Writer: Summary with public URL, admin URL, Jira link
    Writer->>Blog: Share https://blog.zspace.com/{slug}
